WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:07.824
(siren blaring)

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:21.828
(BuzzFeed sound effect)

00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:25.578
(easy listening flute music)

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.101
- Everybody get down on the ground!

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.768
Right now, get down!

00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:39.346
Down!

00:00:39.346 --> 00:00:42.513
Fill my bag, put the money in the bag.

00:00:43.498 --> 00:00:47.248
(easy listening flute music)

00:01:00.054 --> 00:01:02.387
(footsteps)

00:01:06.007 --> 00:01:09.964
- Hello, my name is
Officer Holden Whodoneit,

00:01:09.964 --> 00:01:12.645
in the court of law, decisions
of lasting reprocussion

00:01:12.645 --> 00:01:15.160
are often made based solely
on eyewitness accounts.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.642
From this point on, I'd
like you to rely solely

00:01:17.642 --> 00:01:18.982
on your own memory.

00:01:18.982 --> 00:01:20.934
For the sake of the exercise,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:24.778
do not attempt to review
this video, we will know.

00:01:24.778 --> 00:01:27.173
I'm going to show you
some images of criminals

00:01:27.173 --> 00:01:29.765
matching the description that
you gave the police earlier.

00:01:29.765 --> 00:01:31.280
From these images I'd like you

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:32.762
to identify the man with the gun.

00:01:32.762 --> 00:01:34.932
Can you do that for me?

00:01:34.932 --> 00:01:38.182
(dramatic crime music)

00:01:47.717 --> 00:01:50.075
So, think you know who it was?

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:51.398
Are you sure?

00:01:51.398 --> 00:01:53.112
Are you positive?

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:55.639
Well, based on your eyewitness account

00:01:55.639 --> 00:01:59.538
we were able to arrest
this man, Mike Carrier.

00:01:59.538 --> 00:02:00.803
Thanks for your help.

00:02:00.803 --> 00:02:04.053
(dramatic crime music)

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:10.325
(BuzzFeed sound effect)

